From e33c367766af1d58ce605bf189660d23af746196 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rocky <rocky@zeroclaw>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 20:17:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): ask_user over /ws/chat

WsApprovalChannel answers ask_user (free-form and choices) through the
connected client instead of failing: it emits an ask_user frame
{request_id, question, choices, timeout_secs} and parks until the client
sends ask_user_response {request_id, answer}. Timeout or a detached client
is a tool error. New Channel::request_text for free-form questions on
channels without a send+listen flow.
